{"title":"2013 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaf2370f8ed7c41372c43c2e7f00387c00c1455.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{21}{x}=\\dfrac{7}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"62\" height=\"42\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79c96e270e148516fb5dd4a73725d8be87c80c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/6/c060f8b7284fd457206ee04d265622d601eca337.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46d783347dc9059f615d5444a5ec6e23df3229ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"12\" height=\"36\" />? \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides and then dividing both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/6457e86cb0bb63406a017970857c07e5541162ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21 = \\frac{7x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"68\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/7/667f4c4ba0d96d35785f9d050f5d034665bf86d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y} = \\frac{21}{7} = \\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"107\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232332\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 39/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1304/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.978      1 2013_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    5.978      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36032:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232332 and revision id 279703. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}